<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania's Mkapa leaves for Africa Club meet.</title>
<headline>Tanzania's Mkapa leaves for Africa Club meet.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tanzanian President Benjamin Mkapa left for Botswana on Tuesday for a meeting of African Commonwealth leaders, government officials said.</p>
<p>The three-day meeting in Gaborone is expected to focus on democracy and good governance on the continent.</p>
<p>Mkapa called on Monday for closer cooperation among defence forces in the South African Development Community (SADC) region in a meeting with General George Meiring, South Africa's chief of defence forces.</p>
</text>
